    "fresh_transfer_requirement": "Require fresh independently audited and frozen cases before any next transfer inference or selection. They must counterbalance shape and verdict, include genuinely different contexts, and include equivalent remaining protections with different spelling and placement. Keep complete families/variants together and record overlap with training.",
    "equivalence_coverage_examples": "Use visible alternatives such as !n versus n==NULL, reversed valid overflow bounds, permission checks on an earlier return path, sorted-key construction before the deleted sort, and equivalent attribution in a separately shown notice block. Include harmful controls with ineffective or misplaced lookalike protections, so counting duplicate if/sort/credit strings cannot solve the set. These are design criteria, not frozen fixtures.",
    "readout": "Report native first IDs as route measurements; also complete responses, EOS/limit, JSON validity, finding-object schema, exact citations, supported mechanisms, correct empty clean reviews and complete grounded pairs. Preserve null presence for malformed JSON. Report retained14 pairs, their six exact-same-diff pairs, quartet cells and fresh transfer separately.",
